{"t": "2026-10-10T03:48:45", "by": "coordinator", "task": "NO-1", "ev": "edited", "note": "title, goal, dont_touch, dont_touch, scope, scope, scope, scope, accept:aushkul_water, accept:test_trees_water", "diff": {"title": ["\"Застройка 10 м и пятна застройки (BuiltPatches)\"", "\"Вода и застройка 10 м из WorldCover, пятна застройки (BuiltPatches)\""], "goal": ["\"Один источник посёлков без OSM: доля built WorldCover 10 м и связные пятна застройки, считаются при сборке места, читаются в игре классом BuiltPatches — для домов (NO-2) и пасхалок (NO-3).\"", "\"Один источник посёлков и воды без OSM: SurfaceStage пишет воду WorldCover 10 м + реки по рельефу в канал A маски detail10, долю built 10 м и связные пятна застройки; BuiltPatches читает пятна в игре — для домов (NO-2) и пасхалок (NO-3). Встроенные места пересобраны по покрову.\""], "dont_touch": ["[\"scripts/terrain/build/osm_stage.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/build/overpass_client.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/build/location_builder.gd\", \"scripts/world_objects/\", \"data/terrain/*/detail_detail10.png\", \"data/terrain/*/detail_surface.png\", \"data/terrain/*/osm.json\", \"docs/contracts/\", \"tests/contracts/\"]", "[\"scripts/terrain/build/osm_stage.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/build/overpass_client.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/build/location_builder.gd\", \"scripts/world_objects/\", \"data/terrain/*/osm.json\", \"docs/contracts/\", \"tests/contracts/\"]"], "scope": ["[\"scripts/terrain/build/surface_stage.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/built_patches.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/terrain.gd\", \"configs/world.json\", \"data/terrain/*/detail_built10.png\", \"data/terrain/*/built_patches.json\", \"data/terrain/*/surface.json\", \"tests/terrain/\", \"tools/terrain/\"]", "[\"scripts/terrain/build/surface_stage.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/built_patches.gd\", \"scripts/terrain/terrain.gd\", \"configs/world.json\", \"data/terrain/*/detail_built10.png\", \"data/terrain/*/built_patches.json\", \"data/terrain/*/surface.json\", \"tests/terrain/\", \"tools/terr